---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {settings,json} from '../lib/data';
---
<Layout title="The birthday card"><section class="birthday-page wrap"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING TO KEEP</span><h1>Wrapped in a little card.</h1><p>A direct QR code, made only after your final public cookbook address is confirmed.</p></div><div class="birthday-layout"><div class="birthday-form"><p class="notice">Use your final GitHub Pages address after publication. Don’t print a QR for this demonstration edition if you plan to maintain your recipes on GitHub.</p><form id="qr-form"><label>Published cookbook address<input type="url" name="productionUrl" id="production-url" placeholder="https://yourname.github.io/our-little-cookbook/" value={settings.productionUrl||''} required/></label><label>Card title<input type="text" id="card-title-input" value={settings.cardTitle}/></label><label>Your message<textarea id="card-message-input" rows="3">{settings.cardMessage}</textarea></label><label>Scan instruction<input type="text" id="card-instruction-input" value={settings.cardInstruction}/></label><label class="verification"><input type="checkbox" id="url-verified" required/>I have opened this published address without signing in, and confirmed that it is the cookbook I will keep updating.</label><button class="button" type="submit">Create the birthday QR ↗</button><p class="qr-error" id="qr-error" role="status"></p></form><div class="birthday-downloads" id="qr-downloads" hidden><a id="qr-svg" class="button secondary" download="cookbook-qr.svg">Download SVG</a><a id="qr-png" class="button secondary" download="cookbook-qr.png">Download PNG</a><button type="button" class="button" data-print>Print the card</button></div><p class="print-card-note">The card prints at A6 size on an A4 page. Use 100% scale, and turn off browser headers and footers. The PNG is 1,200 pixels wide. Keep the white border around the QR. Test a printed copy on both phones before placing it in the birthday card.</p></div><div><article class="gift-card"><span class="eyebrow">FROM MY KITCHEN, TO YOURS</span><h2 id="card-title">{settings.cardTitle}</h2><p id="card-message">{settings.cardMessage}</p><div class="qr-placeholder" id="qr-placeholder">Your QR belongs here.<br/>Add your published address first.</div><img id="card-qr" alt="QR code opening your published cookbook" hidden width="1200" height="1200"/><small id="card-instruction">{settings.cardInstruction}</small><p id="card-url"></p></article></div></div></section><script type="application/json" id="birthday-data" set:html={json(settings)}/><script>import {initBirthday} from '../scripts/birthday.mjs';initBirthday();</script></Layout>
